+        ! Purpose: 
+        !   Compute sag (z-coordinate) of conic surface at radial distance rho
+        ! 
+        !   Conic surface equation (standard form with curvature c):
+        !     z = (c*rho^2) / (1 + sqrt(1 - (1+Kc)*c^2*rho^2))
+        ! 
